WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.740
<i>After returning from our long break in May,</i>

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.230
<i>we have a mock entrance exam.</i>

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:09.290
<i>However, spring still holds 
our class in its drowsy haze,</i>

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:10.860
<i>leaving no room for anxiety.</i>

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.070
<b>Strawberry Marshmallows</b>

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.070
This sucks.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.620
Why do we have to take a mock exam?

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:20.380
This isn't worth losing our 
precious vacation days over.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:21.630
I know, right?

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:24.330
This is like working during a holiday.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.240
If it's a mock exam,

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.800
don't we have to write down the
 school we want to attend?

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.580
I still don't know what 
I want to do yet,

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.760
so I never know what to write.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:41.490
Maybe I'll put down Todai 
as my number one choice,

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.060
even though I'll probably get an F.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.290
No, an F would be too good for you.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.810
Chizuru, you're a Z.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.920
I don't care.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.990
Anyway, do you guys want 
to go get ramen after school?

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.180
A new place opened in 
front of the station.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.900
They're selling ramen for 
100 yen today only.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.370
Really? Thick or thin?

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:05.280
Super-greasy, voluminous pork bone ramen!

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:07.190
Oh, sorry.

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:09.170
I've got my club today.

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.980
The Tea Club meets today?

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.160
Shun-chan, I'll be so lonely without you.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:18.010
So lonely.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.010
Is tea fun?

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.380
Yes, it sure is.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:25.450
Once a week, our tea instructor comes by,

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.240
and we drink tea and eat...

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:29.530
delicious Japanese sweets.

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.440
You eat Japanese sweets, too?

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:33.840
That sounds great.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.450
You get to have snack 
time with the Tea Club.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:39.860
The Tea Club sure sounds fun.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:42.260
Maybe I should give it a try...

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:45.740
Chizuru-kun, why don't 
you come with me today?

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:47.500
It can be your trial run.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.120
What, really?

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:51.590
Yes, of course.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:53.210
Yuki-kun, if you'd like, 
you can come, too.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.160
Really? Me too?

00:01:55.160 --> 00:02:00.040
Yes. I'll go tell Yuta-kun 
what you two are doing.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.220
Hooray.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:02.680
Chizuru, what about the ramen?

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:05.970
<b>Strawberry Marshmallow</b>

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:05.970
Naw, s'okay. We can get on down there later.

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:07.730
Where'd that Kansai dialect come from?

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:32.190
Yuta-kun, Kaname-kun.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.730
Today, I'm...

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.190
<b>College Guide</b>

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.450
Shun, what's wrong?

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.540
Oh, um...

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.920
I was talking to 
Chizuru-kun and Yuki-kun...

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.120
about them coming to 
the club with me today...

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.700
Well, it should be okay.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.990
We always seem to have more 
Japanese sweets than we need.

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:56.090
They're just going for 
the sweets, aren't they?

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.420
Kaname, do you want to come, too?

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.900
Huh? No.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:02.970
I've got to study for 
tomorrow's mock exam.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.930
Don't be like that.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.260
<b>College Guide</b>

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:09.050
It's good for people like you to go.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:10.980
It'll help lower your stress levels.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.730
Whose younger brother do you 
think stresses me out?

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.770
<b>Strawberry Marshmallow</b>

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.600
<i>They've been thinking about it...</i>

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:22.980
<i>It's time for us to decide what 
we want to do with our lives.</i>

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:26.660
<i>Not like before.</i>

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:38.670
I wonder if kisses are 
fluffy like marshmallows.

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:44.170
How embarrassing!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.880
How long have you been watching?

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.450
Not long.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:51.640
Since you started looking 
for a stuffed animal.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.980
You saw the whole thing!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.180
What were you doing, anyway?

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.230
I was practicing.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:03.860
I don't want to mess up my life's 
one and only first kiss.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.110
I see.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.640
What do you do with your 
hands when you kiss?

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:11.690
Do you keep them at your sides?

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:14.370
What? That would ruin the mood.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:18.120
Isn't the man supposed to hold 
the other person's hands?

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.790
Gently and softly.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.250
Like this?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.430
Kaname-kun, if you don't firmly 
grab on to their shoulders,

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:26.020
won't they run away from you?

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:27.870
What about your eyes?

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.350
Who's supposed to close them?

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.810
Kaname-kun, if you close your eyes,

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.780
won't they escape while 
they have the chance?

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:36.150
You can't let your guard 
down for an instant.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.810
Shut up already!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.190
Oh, your breath!

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:44.440
Can you breathe while you kiss?

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.970
I can't even hold my 
breath for ten seconds.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.580
Your breath, huh?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.940
I guess your mouths are stuck together.

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:54.410
If you get caught up in the moment, 
would you suffocate to death?

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:59.360
Wouldn't it be wonderful 
to leave this world...

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.900
beside the one you love?

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:01.670
Wouldn't it just?

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:05.070
That's so dramatic.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.270
You're lying!

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:08.800
Love's meant to be 
shared when you're alive!

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:13.890
What are you doing?

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:15.820
Yuta-kun!

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.310
Nothing!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:18.940
Here.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:18.940
<b>College Guide</b>

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.500
You seemed interested in it, 
so you can borrow it.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.930
It's Kaname's, though.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.570
Well, see you later.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.830
Okay, get to your seats.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.350
Chizuru-kun. Yuki-kun.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:56.780
I have to go get ready, 
so I'll go on ahead.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:59.050
Okay. We'll catch up later.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.320
Matsuoka-kun.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:04.860
Yes?

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.860
Did you want to ask me something?

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:07.810
What?

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:10.480
If you don't, that's fine.

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:14.370
Um...

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:20.630
Azuma-sensei, when did you 
decide to become a teacher?

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:29.560
Probably when I entered college.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:33.180
When deciding on my major,

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:38.000
I naturally thought about what 
sort of job I'd like to have.

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:42.100
So, you'd already decided 
what you wanted to do...

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.770
by the time you were our age.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:49.230
Well, I guess so.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:51.950
I see.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:52.590
Huh?

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.320
Thank you. Excuse me.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.000
There.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.330
Shun-chan?

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:22.280
Shun-chan.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.460
Masaki-chan.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.690
Y-You're going to your club now?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:28.940
Yes.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:30.550
I see.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:38.020
B-Boys don't usually join the Tea Club.

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:40.830
Shun-chan, why did you 
join the Tea Club?

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.760
I don't really have a reason.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:50.800
When I passed by their room 
while we were visiting all the clubs,

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.010
I smelled the appealing aroma of tea.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:56.740
Yuta-kun said he would join, too, so...

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.600
I see. I just thought it was nice.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:02.920
See you later.

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:04.400
Have fun at your club.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:05.920
Okay.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:13.820
<i>I really don't think about anything.</i>

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:15.240
Shun-chan.

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.400
Let's get started.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.630
Oh, right.

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:22.720
Sorry.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:28.670
I'll start by teaching you 
the basics of sitting.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:32.260
What? Who cares about that?

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.320
Where are the Japanese sweets?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.320
I'm hungry.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.480
No, Chizuru-kun.

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:38.680
Graceful movements...

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.720
are an important element of the tea ceremony.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:49.980
Okay, first, sit up straight like 
you're sticking out your navel.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.320
I told you, I don't care about that.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.770
It's too stiff.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:57.650
A beautiful posture would 
definitely look much better.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:01.950
Shun-chan, if good posture 
were all it took to be a man,

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.490
no one would...

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:11.730
What?

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:13.720
Shun-chan, what did 
you say about navels?

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:16.110
It's cool for your navel to jump out?

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:18.340
No, you have to stick it out.

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:20.930
Forward, forward, forward, forward...

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.610
If it jumped out, it'd be an outie.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.480
Like this, Shun-chan?

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:28.230
What excitement. Are these your friends?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:29.900
Tsunashi-sensei.

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:38.510
They're all here for the day 
to experience the club.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:42.490
I see. How wonderful.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:46.900
Young people aren't often interested.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:51.400
This is Tsunashi-sensei, 
the man who teaches us...

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:52.710
how to perform a tea ceremony.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:54.750
Nice to meet you.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.020
My name is Tsunashi.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:02.010
Is there something on my head?

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:05.000
No, nothing.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.020
There's nothing on your head... at all.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:11.760
Matsuoka-kun, thank you for doing this.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:13.020
Yes.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:20.320
You're not little kids anymore.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.430
Don't make such a fuss over 
what's on a person's head.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.030
I'm not laughing.

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:33.380
But, Yutan, having a bald person 
suddenly enter your day...

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.720
would shock anyone.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.690
You idiot.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:39.120
I was so surprised.

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:42.340
I thought a giant white 
dango had come in.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:47.650
Yuki-kun, he'll hear you.

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.150
I see.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:53.790
It seems you're all awfully 
interested in my head.

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.440
Harmony, respect, purity, tranquility.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.940
Hairless, receding, plain, trimmed?

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:02.990
It's an expression coined 
by Rikyu to express...

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.610
the spirit of the tea ceremony.

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:08.570
"Approach tea with respect for others...

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:11.120
and a harmonious, pure, 
and tranquil heart."

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.070
In others words, you must...

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:18.320
treasure the relaxation 
provided by an unmoved heart...

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:21.230
no matter what happens, 
even if my head is bald.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.300
This is what it means.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.680
That's right.

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:30.580
No matter what kind of 
person appears before you,

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:33.020
your heart must never move.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.500
This is delicious!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.500
These sweets are delicious!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:44.920
And they look so nice!

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:48.560
Shun-chan, do you always 
eat stuff like this?

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:49.910
This is the best!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.040
I'm glad you like it.

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:56.220
A tea ceremony with delicious 
tea and Japanese sweets.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:01.300
Looks like I know what I wanna do.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.590
You know what you want 
to do in the future?

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:07.160
I'll follow the path of tea.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:10.320
I'll write Ochanomizu 
as my first choice school...

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:12.430
on tomorrow's mock exam.

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.080
They don't study tea there.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.860
And it's a girls' school.

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:19.750
Don't bother.

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:24.320
Tea isn't something you can do, Chizuru.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:27.120
You don't know that yet.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.570
Right, Tsunashi-sensei?

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:37.750
Well, I'm very happy to meet a 
young person who feels that way.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:38.830
See?

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.970
As long as you're here,

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:45.170
why don't you learn about 
the ceremony in more detail?

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.510
Really?

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.760
All right!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.760
Learning about this ceremony...

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.430
will turn my third year...

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.180
of high school self into more of an adult!

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:15.910
How nice.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.180
Watching this sort of 
thing always calms me.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:20.830
Yeah.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:26.540
All your stress will be washed away now.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.440
Yeah.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:32.950
I don't think I can wash all of it away 
with this meager amount of tea, though.

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.520
Chizuru, are you watching this?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.730
He's going out of his way for you...

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:48.800
You idiot!

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:50.370
Don't poke my feet!

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.210
Huh?

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:53.950
I can't feel anything.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.660
It must have fallen asleep.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.860
Try some thick tea.

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.500
Huh? Just me?

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.600
You're meant to pass...

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:09.010
the thick tea around and 
share it with everyone.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.540
It's so bitter!

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:20.390
Why is it so freaking bitter?

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.540
So bitter!

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:23.440
How is your bowl?

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.310
Huh?

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.050
How is my what?

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:29.450
He's asking you about the 
strength of the tea.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:32.050
In the Japanese tea ceremony, each drink...

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.150
is called a bowl instead of a glass.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.300
When he asks you,

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:40.060
you're supposed to tell him it's fine.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:42.460
Yeah, it's definitely fine!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.490
I'm fine in more ways than one!

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:49.720
Do you call this a bowl because 
you put a bowl of poison in it?

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:53.110
Is that why it's so lethally bitter?

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:55.270
Matsuoka-kun,

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:59.180
why don't you get everyone 
to look at the implements?

00:15:59.180 --> 00:15:59.680
Huh?

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.730
What? What are we looking at?

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:04.850
Well, after you drink tea,

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:06.820
you're supposed to pick up the bowl...

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:08.950
you used and look at it, but...

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:14.540
Most bowls used for 
thick tea are expensive,

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:17.640
so make sure you don't 
damage or break it.

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.540
Especially you, Chizuru-san.

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:23.240
Hey, if you tell me not to break something,

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.240
I'm bound to break it.

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:27.630
You should give up on the path of tea...

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.300
and follow the path of comedy instead.

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:34.160
I don't get it.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:38.210
Why is this thing so expensive?

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:41.500
I wouldn't give this a second 
thought even if someone...

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.350
served me boiled potatoes in this.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:47.640
I know, right? If people 
pay money for this,

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.130
I could've made a fortune...

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.680
in a single summer as a grade schooler.

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:54.700
Don't treat this like your 
summer art projects.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.460
And doesn't it look like a reject?

00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:00.270
Its shape is all distorted.

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:03.890
I bet they try to trick you by 
calling this deformation "flavor."

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.710
You're the ones who are distorted.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:09.210
I wonder how much it is. 
It's expensive, right?

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:12.210
Three Noguchi Hideos?

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.380
Three Fukuzawa Yukichis.

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:20.310
You idiot, don't let me hold 
something so expensive!

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:25.100
What are you doing?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.240
I'm done.

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.270
I can't do this tea stuff.

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:35.100
Who was it? Who recommended 
the path of tea to me?

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:36.110
It was you.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.770
How unfortunate.

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.530
However, should you ever 
feel like it again,

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:43.540
please try pursuing the path of tea.

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:50.300
You can obtain a teaching license 
through study at any age.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.590
What? Really?

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.140
Tsunashi-sensei, when did you decide...

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.640
to become a tea instructor?

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:04.490
When was it?

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:11.400
My family has been teaching 
the tea ceremony for generations,

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:15.340
so I have studied tea 
since I was very young.

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:22.160
I never thought about making 
this my future career,

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:28.210
and I certainly never thought I'd 
become a tea instructor myself.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:28.920
What?

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:32.170
Really? Then, why did you 
follow the path of tea?

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.360
Well...

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:40.870
Probably because I was much better 
at it than language or math.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.890
What? That's it?

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.100
Surprisingly, yes.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.520
Then, when you were our age...

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:51.380
I hadn't really thought about it.

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:55.550
Only a few people can 
imagine their future...

00:18:55.550 --> 00:19:00.570
in their third year of high school.

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:05.330
Tsunashi-sensei, you were 
a lot like Chizuru.

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:08.620
You both started tea on a whim.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.790
Oh? Does that mean what 
I think it means?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.840
Doesn't that mean I might 
become a tea instructor?

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:18.990
No, you're not cut 
from the same cloth.

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.110
What did you say?

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:26.350
When I grow up, I'll be a proper 
adult like Tsunashi-sensei!

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:27.410
Right?

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:32.830
Is that the last bell?

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:35.530
Is that the time already?

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:36.630
Let's go, Yukki!

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:38.460
They might run out of ramen!

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.200
Chizuru-kun...

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.830
The only thing that's changed 
since I became an adult...

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.060
is that, unlike when I was younger,

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:54.750
my legs don't fall asleep 
when I sit anymore.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:13.180
Where did everyone go?

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:15.290
They left.

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:16.900
They said they were off to eat ramen.

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:20.620
Kaname said he wanted to 
study for the mock exam.

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.380
I see.

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:24.670
Shun.

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:25.630
Yes?

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.320
Do you want me to make you some tea?

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:28.000
What?

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.760
You spent all your time 
teaching everyone today...

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:32.460
and didn't get to drink any yourself.

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:03.180
How is your bowl?

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.900
Yuta-kun, have you already 
decided which university...

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:12.470
you want to go to?

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:13.190
Huh?

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:14.000
Oh, nothing.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:17.200
You were looking at college 
literature today, so...

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:21.040
No, I don't know yet.

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:24.140
I was just looking to 
see what's out there.

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:27.570
I wonder why we have to write what school...

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.810
we want to attend on a mock exam.

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:31.100
I don't know what to do about it.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.090
You're right.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.780
But I...

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:43.400
Unlike you, I still haven't 
even researched colleges yet.

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:48.160
Even though everyone around us 
is acting like there isn't a test,

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:52.000
Kaname-kun's studying for tomorrow.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:54.990
It's amazing.

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:59.430
I haven't even thought 
about what I want to do,

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:03.340
so I was surprised to see what 
the two of you were doing.

00:22:04.680 --> 00:22:08.600
Not so much surprised, but... Well...

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:09.320
Shun.

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:12.280
Your navel.

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:20.900
How is your bowl?

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:30.880
It is fine.

00:22:45.740 --> 00:22:46.590
Huh?

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:48.420
What's wrong?

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:49.900
We've been waiting.

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:53.810
We decided to study for tomorrow's 
test at Kanamecchi's.

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:54.740
Sheesh.

00:22:54.740 --> 00:22:55.950
What about your ramen?

00:22:55.950 --> 00:22:58.360
We can pick up some instant 
ramen on the way home.

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:00.970
You can make it, Kaname.

00:23:01.590 --> 00:23:03.110
I have to do it?

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:05.110
All you have to do is 
pour hot water on it.

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:07.110
Let's go!

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>We still can't imagine...</i>

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:29.530
<i>our futures or foresee what they hold...</i>

00:23:34.630 --> 00:23:37.620
<i>but we'll all change slowly.</i>

00:23:39.550 --> 00:23:42.810
Shun-chan, let's go.

00:23:43.570 --> 00:23:47.010
<i>In the same way that 
we've matured a little.</i>

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:49.400
Coming!

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:05.300
Navel and Dignity
